      <h2 class="sec-headline">From Red Sea to Regional War</h2>
      <p class="sec-lead">The Houthis transformed from a regional insurgency into a major international actor after October 7, 2023. Their campaign targeting commercial shipping in the Red Sea disrupted global trade and drew unprecedented international military response. They then entered the 2026 Iran War in support of Iran.</p>

